# Craftbot grid SOP (0817-x) — never repeat V/W

Pack **V** used `$CONTENT_DATA`. Pack **W** wrapped only `Crafter.cl_updateRecipeGrid`. Both failed. **0817-x is the fix.** Edit `Scripts/game/RfsCrafterGrid.lua` only for this path.

## Custom Game vs ModDatabase

Custom Game Craftbot does **not** get this pack’s recipes via ModDatabase lid-scan. A Custom Game is not a world mod; RFS lid `29c99287-1213-48c7-9471-19a4a5c12247` is not in ModDatabase’s catalog.

ModDatabase (`40639a2c-bb9f-4d4f-b88c-41bfe264ffa8` in `description.json`) still loads **subscribed B&P** packs (Intelligentia). Do not enable it as a world mod. Skip Nutt World Map lid `58df2b8e-…`.

GPS/tools **in this Custom Game** need `RfsCrafterGrid.lua`. Appending our lid to the scan does nothing.

## Patch Craftbot, not only Crafter

Survival `Craftbot = class(Crafter)` **copies methods** at `class()` time. Wrapping only `Crafter.cl_updateRecipeGrid` leaves vanilla `Craftbot.cl_updateRecipeGrid` running.

Must `dofile("$SURVIVAL_DATA/Scripts/game/interactables/Crafter.lua")` then patch **Craftbot** (and Crafter; PortableCraftbot if present).

## C++ path — never `$CONTENT_DATA`

```
# BAD (V): C++ does not resolve $CONTENT_DATA (same as GPS IconMap)
addGridItemsFromFile("RecipeGrid", "$CONTENT_DATA/CraftingRecipes/craftbot.json", opts)

# GOOD (0817-x)
addGridItemsFromFile("RecipeGrid", "$CONTENT_29c99287-1213-48c7-9471-19a4a5c12247/CraftingRecipes/craftbot.json", opts)
```

Hack Beacon shapes stay the same lid prefix + `CraftingRecipes/craftbot_rfs.json`.

## Hideout toast ≠ grid

Hideout “learned” is `RecipeManager.Sv_UnlockRecipe` only. Unlock only unhides a uuid **already on the C++ grid**. Toast is not proof GPS is on Craftbot.

## Tools tab = ToolSet uuid

GPS `d96c2fe4-177b-49bb-be40-e4b1bcdd8f76` in `Tools/Database/ToolSets/rfs_minimap.toolset`. C++ puts `sm.tool.uuidExists` items on Tools. Same uuid on Hideout trade `itemId`. Tools have no shape title — do not drop the row on `getShapeTitle` == "not found".

## Do not invent

- `$USER_DATA` / `$TEMP_DATA` merge files / `rfs_craftbot_other.json`
- `skipGps`, Lua `sm.json.open` hooks, rewriting Survival `craftbot_other`
- Wrap-only-Crafter (W)
- `$CONTENT_DATA` for `addGridItemsFromFile` (V)

## Schematic lock — after the row exists

After the GPS row is proven on the C++ grid, lock is Hideout **1 Farmer** (`CraftingRecipes/hideout_trades.json`) + `g_unlockableCraftItems` / hidden. Do not add that lock until the uuid is in that `craftbot.json` file C++ actually loads.
